OL,3,GNEWSAWill Sebastian Croft surprise us
OL,4,Ain Celebrity Traitors?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSebastian Croft has been described as
OL,7,Fan "under-the-radar contender" in the
OL,8,Flatest series of Celebrity Traitors, so
OL,9,Fwhat do we know about the young actor
OL,10,Fand singer?
OL,12,FThe hit BBC show returned this week
OL,13,Ffilled to the brim with world famous
OL,14,Ffaces, including Michael Sheen, Richard
OL,15,FE. Grant, Jerry Hall, and James Blunt.
OL,17,FThe BBC's preview suggests that
OL,18,F"younger viewers will know all about
OL,19,FOxfordshire's Croft... but will the
OL,20,Folder contestants?"
